DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_D1D3_994F';
<p>d1d3_994f</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #775900;">Gene E</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #775900;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #775900;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #086594;">Gene T</span></strong> is linked with the '<span style="color: #086594;"><i>tipsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #086594;">Gene T</span> moves in an erratic path, suggesting a lack of coordination, as if intoxicated.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #8a378a;">Gene X</span></strong> is affiliated with the '<span style="color: #8a378a;"><i>xanthic</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #8a378a;">Gene X</span> has a fluorescent bright yellow coloring.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, tipsy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">100</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,492</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">14,257</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe7bb; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">499</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy, xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">515</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">tipsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d9edff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">t</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">13,773</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">xanthic</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffdffa; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">x</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">5,250</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #775900;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #086594;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #8a378a;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">114</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">40,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>T</b> and <b>X</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>T</b> and <b>X</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_D1D3_994F
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(100 + 114 + 499 + 13,773)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>14,486</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.3622 = <strong>36.22 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(100 + 114 + 499 + 5,250)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>5,963</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.1491 = <strong>14.91 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(100 + 114 + 499 + 515)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>1,228</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.0307 = <strong>3.07 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(100 + 114 + 5,250 + 5,492)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>10,956</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.2739 = <strong>27.39 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(114 + 515 + 5,492 + 14,257)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>20,378</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.5094 = <strong>50.94 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(13,773 + 14,257)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>28,030</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.7007 = <strong>70.08 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(100 + 114 + 499 + 515)</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = <sup>1,228</sup>/<sub>40,000</sub> = 0.0307 = <strong>3.07 cM</strong>
LITERAL_D1D3_994F_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
